Subject: [PATCH 44/46] d/rift_s: Add the occlusion motion models from
 lbgos/rift-s-linux

rift_s_motion.{h,cpp} and tests_rift_s_motion.cpp copied unchanged from
lbgos/rift-s-linux 920bfdd (BSL-1.0): at rest, near head, hand over
hand, behind back and out of view state machines that replace a lost
controller position, plus a torso estimate. Built, not used yet.

